abstract: >-
  BioSuite Ultra is an integrated open-source bioinformatics platform written
  in pure Python. It provides 47 analysis modules covering sequence analysis,
  alignment, phylogenetics, transcriptomics, genomics, population genetics,
  proteomics and metabolism; a plotting library of 105 public functions;
  molecular cloning tools with a 169-enzyme restriction table; and
  reproducible workflows with provenance tracking. The same core is exposed
  as a Python library, an interactive command-line interface, a CustomTkinter
  desktop application and a 38-endpoint FastAPI REST service. Core
  functionality requires no external bioinformatics binaries; where optional
  external tools are available they are used in preference to the built-in
  approximations. Released under the MIT license.
